    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HB91RXD03JGQW4Y35JQB19AD\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to use Wix contact labels to segment customers in Klaviyo. Wix contact labels are assigned as a list type <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005074627-Add-Custom-Properties-to-a-Contact-Profile#how-to-use-custom-properties\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">custom property</a> on each customer’s Klaviyo profile. These profiles sync into Klaviyo through your Wix integration.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HB91RXD11QJ620VPVXRY20ET\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>If you have not already, read our article on <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/6202669053723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Getting started with Wix</a> for step-by-step instructions on integrating, before continuing with this article.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HB91RXD17THJ2CKDDHFHCKDY\">Segment people associated with a single Wix contact label</h2>\n<p>To create a segment of customers associated with a particular Wix contact label:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In Klaviyo, click the <strong>Audience</strong> dropdown and select <strong>Lists &amp; segments</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create List/Segment,</strong> then select <strong>Segment</strong>.</li>\n<li>Name your segment.</li>\n<li>Under <em>Definition</em>, choose <strong>Properties about someone &gt; Wix Labels</strong>.</li>\n<li>The <em>Type</em> field will then automatically set to <em>List</em>.</li>\n<li>Type the name of the label you'd like to use in the box after “<em>contains</em>.”</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create Segment</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717994667291\" alt=\"Segment builder with segment Wix Label Subscribers\" width=\"579\" height=\"213\"><br><br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HB91S7ZVBS2B5M6G438YR6VM\">Segment people associated with multiple Wix contact labels</h2>\n<p>To create a segment of customers associated with multiple Wix contact labels:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In Klaviyo, click the <strong>Audience</strong> dropdown and select <strong>Lists &amp; segments</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create List/Segment</strong>, then select <strong>Segment</strong>.</li>\n<li>Name your segment.</li>\n<li>Under <em>Definition</em>, choose <strong><em>Properties about someone &gt; Wix Labels</em></strong><em>.</em>\n</li>\n<li>The <em>Type</em> field will then automatically set to <em>List</em>.</li>\n<li>Type the name of the first tag you'd like to use in the box after “<em>contains</em>.”</li>\n<li>Click <strong>And</strong>.</li>\n<li>Add another condition for each tag you would like to use, just like you did the first one.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create Segment</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28718022424091\" alt=\"Segment builder with segment Wix Label Contacts and Subscribers\" width=\"591\" height=\"306\"><br><br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HB91RXD1XP69NFKBFK3RZKWB\">Segment people without a Wix contact label</h2>\n<p>You may want to create a segment of people who are not associated with a Wix contact label. To create this segment:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In Klaviyo, click the<strong> Audience</strong> dropdown and select <strong>Lists &amp; segments.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create List/Segment </strong>and select <strong>Segment.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Name your segment.</li>\n<li>Under <em>Definition</em>, choose <strong>Properties about someone &gt; Wix Labels</strong><em>.</em>\n</li>\n<li>Choose <strong>is empty </strong>as the option.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create Segment.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28718022429723\" alt=\"Segment builder with segment no wix label\" width=\"572\" height=\"239\"></strong><strong><br></strong>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HB91RXD1VRKD9GVX83RGTQDZ\">Use Wix contact labels in a flow filter</h2>\n<p>You can also use Wix contact labels within a flow filter, just like you did when building a segment. When editing the flow filter:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select <strong><em>Properties about someone &gt; Wix Labels &gt; contains</em></strong>.</li>\n<li>Select the label you wish to use as your filter under “<em>Dimension value</em>”.</li>\n<li>Make sure <em>Type</em> is set to <strong>Text</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28718022419739\" alt=\"Trigger setup in flow builder with dimension value dropdown open showing options such as contact, contacted me, subscribers, etc\" width=\"347\" height=\"417\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HB91RXD1J7JV5PSRWPM2Z6VP\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005074627-Add-Custom-Properties-to-a-Contact-Profile#how-to-use-custom-properties\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Profile properties reference</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002774932-Getting-Started-with-Flows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Getting started with flows</a></li>\n</ul>",
